  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/05/IMG_6093.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>A la imatge principal, moment en que arriba l&#39;&uacute;ltim llibre de Joan Pla, Conquistarem el cim, al recinte de la 33&ordf; Fira del Llibre d&#39;Onda, que estar&agrave; oberta fins diumenge 27 al passeig d&#39;acc&eacute;s al pavell&oacute; V&iacute;ctor Cabedo Carda, amb entrada per l&#39;avinguda de Catalunya.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfirallibreonda18/img_6055.jpg\" alt=\"img_6055\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfirallibreonda18/img_6056.jpg\" alt=\"img_6056\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfirallibreonda18/img_6057.jpg\" alt=\"img_6057\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfirallibreonda18/img_6058.jpg\" alt=\"img_6058\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfirallibreonda18/img_6059.jpg\" alt=\"img_6059\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfirallibreonda18/img_6060.jpg\" alt=\"img_6060\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfirallibreonda18/img_6061.jpg\" alt=\"img_6061\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfirallibreonda18/img_6062.jpg\" alt=\"img_6062\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfirallibreonda18/img_6063.jpg\" alt=\"img_6063\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><i